# Shell scripts MUST be checked out with LF endings.
#
# The one-shot `env-gen` compose service runs scripts/generate-env.sh under
# busybox `sh` (alpine). With a CRLF checkout the script dies immediately:
#
#   /app/scripts/generate-env.sh: set: line 23: illegal option -o pipefail
#
# because busybox sees the option name as "pipefail\r". Windows checkouts
# otherwise convert these files to CRLF via core.autocrlf=true.
*.sh text eol=lf
